      "answer": "For the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot, the temporary field mappings planned in the SI-CLOUD-ROUTER transform include mapping txn_id to transaction_id, total_amount to amount_cents, applying type coercion from string to int, preserving key fields store_id and register_id, and adding a transformation flag field _ns_transform=true. The transform also enables OR-AUDIT-LOGS for each transformed event for audit purposes [art_5a91258f4056].\n\nThe March 23 workshop is a Schema Signoff Workshop with attendees including Sophie Tremblay, Marc Gauthier, Ellen Park, Platform engineers, and Northstar SE/Ing teams. The agenda is to agree on a canonical schema for payment, register_events, and sensor_thermo; define alias mapping; and plan producer migration. The deliverable is a signed schema document uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG and a change control ticket with producer migration milestones [art_5a91258f4056].",
